## 4. Post-Deployment Validation Checklist

After completing all deployment steps, SRE should perform the following validations.

| No. | Validation Activity | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Database creation | Redaction database is available in MS RDS |
| 2 | Database user creation | User and credentials are available |
| 3 | Secrets Manager | Database secret is available |
| 4 | RDS Proxy access (RC/PROD) | New database user is configured |
| 5 | Glue VPC endpoint SG | Required network access is available |
| 6 | KMS | Required KMS resources are available |
| 7 | S3 | Required buckets are created |
| 8 | IAM | Required roles and policies are configured |
| 9 | Lambda | All five Lambda functions are deployed |
| 10 | Glue | All four Glue jobs are deployed |
| 11 | S3 Event Notification | Scanning Lambda trigger is configured |
| 12 | Application validation | Components are operational |

## 5. Manual Activities Summary

The following activities require manual intervention during deployment.

| No. | Activity | Applicable Environment | Frequency |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Configure new database user access in RDS Proxy | RC and PROD | Per database deployment |
| 2 | Update baseline security group for Glue VPC endpoint | All applicable environments | Once per AWS account |
| 3 | Re-run S3 landing bucket IaC stack to apply event notification after scanning Lambda deployment/rebuild | Applicable environments | Whenever required after Lambda deployment/rebuild |

## 6. Deployment Execution Order

Follow the sequence below to ensure dependencies are satisfied.

1. Create Redaction database using the database build pipeline.
2. For RC and PROD, configure the newly created database user in RDS Proxy.
3. Update the baseline Glue VPC endpoint security group (once per AWS account).
4. Deploy PCI Redaction infrastructure using the IaC pipeline.
5. Deploy Lambda and Glue components using the Master Deployment Pipeline.
6. Re-run the S3 landing bucket IaC stack to configure/refresh the S3 event notification after the scanning Lambda is deployed or rebuilt.
7. Complete post-deployment validation.

